ding=\"async\" title=\"星\" width=\"16\" height=\"20\" style=\"vertical-align: middle\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Star_liang.png/24px-Star_liang.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/f/f4/Star_liang.png/32px-Star_liang.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"68\" data-file-height=\"84\" /> 击败全部敌人<br /></div><div class=\"battle-info\"><div class=\"battle-info-title\">奖励<span class=\"battle-info-subtitle\">REWARD</span></div><div class=\"battle-info-empty\"><div><img alt=\"无奖励\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Bg_kong.png/200px-Bg_kong.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"无奖励\" width=\"200\" height=\"52\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Bg_kong.png/300px-Bg_kong.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/c/c9/Bg_kong.png/400px-Bg_kong.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"454\" data-file-height=\"118\" /></div></div></div><div class=\"battle-info\"><div class=\"battle-info-title\">试用角色<span class=\"battle-info-subtitle\">TRIAL HEROS</span></div><div style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:small\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3092\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E6%88%88%E5%B0%94\" title=\"伊戈尔\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E6%88%88%E5%B0%94\" title=\"伊戈尔\"><img alt=\"伊戈尔\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-309201.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d4/HeadIconSmall-309201.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E4%BC%8A%E6%88%88%E5%B0%94\" title=\"伊戈尔\">伊戈尔</a></span></span>：<img alt=\"洞悉Ⅲ\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/20px-Dongxi_da_003.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"洞悉Ⅲ\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" style=\"vertical-align: sub\" class=\"level-icon\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/30px-Dongxi_da_003.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/40px-Dongxi_da_003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"76\" data-file-height=\"64\" />Lv.60 | 2级塑造</div><div style=\"font-size:small; text-align:right\">装配<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1562\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%8C%E8%87%B3%E9%98%BF%E5%88%BB%E6%88%8E\" title=\"行至阿刻戎\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%8C%E8%87%B3%E9%98%BF%E5%88%BB%E6%88%8E\" title=\"行至阿刻戎\"><img alt=\"行至阿刻戎\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Equipment_icon-1562.png/100px-Equipment_icon-1562.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Equipment_icon-1562.png/150px-Equipment_icon-1562.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/6/64/Equipment_icon-1562.png/200px-Equipment_icon-1562.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%A1%8C%E8%87%B3%E9%98%BF%E5%88%BB%E6%88%8E\" title=\"行至阿刻戎\">行至阿刻戎</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"item-infobox\"><span>进入战斗时，每存在一个灵感为<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[兽]</span>的角色（包括记忆者在内），记忆者仪式威力提升<span class=\"color-value\">4%</span>，最多叠加4层；<br />回合开始时，记忆者每拥有1种子弹，造成伤害提升<span class=\"color-value\">2%</span>，最多叠加6层，持续1回合</span></span></span></span></span>：Lv.60 | 5级增幅</div><div style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:small\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3102\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%9B%E4%BD%A9%E6%8B%89\" title=\"洛佩拉\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%9B%E4%BD%A9%E6%8B%89\" title=\"洛佩拉\"><img alt=\"洛佩拉\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-310201.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/a/a9/HeadIconSmall-310201.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E6%B4%9B%E4%BD%A9%E6%8B%89\" title=\"洛佩拉\">洛佩拉</a></span></span>：<img alt=\"洞悉Ⅲ\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/20px-Dongxi_da_003.png\" decoding=\"async\" title=\"洞悉Ⅲ\" width=\"20\" height=\"17\" style=\"vertical-align: sub\" class=\"level-icon\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/30px-Dongxi_da_003.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/3/36/Dongxi_da_003.png/40px-Dongxi_da_003.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"76\" data-file-height=\"64\" />Lv.60 | 2级塑造</div><div style=\"font-size:small; text-align:right\">装配<span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"1537\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%AC%A1%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%BB\" title=\"第三次信任\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%AC%A1%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%BB\" title=\"第三次信任\"><img alt=\"第三次信任\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Equipment_icon-1537.png/100px-Equipment_icon-1537.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Equipment_icon-1537.png/150px-Equipment_icon-1537.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/b/b9/Equipment_icon-1537.png/200px-Equipment_icon-1537.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"248\" data-file-height=\"248\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E7%AC%AC%E4%B8%89%E6%AC%A1%E4%BF%A1%E4%BB%BB\" title=\"第三次信任\">第三次信任</a><span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\"><span class=\"item-infobox\"><span>攻击触发子弹后，自身暴击创伤提高<span class=\"color-value\">16%</span>，持续2回合；记忆者布设<span class=\"tooltips color-sk\">[<span style=\"text-decoration:underline;\">术阵</span>]<span class=\"tooltips-content\" style=\"text-align:left;\">战场效果，能够持续影响场上角色（敌我双方同时只能存在<span class=\"color-value\">1</span>种术阵）</span></span>时，为术阵附加额外效果：己方全体术法威力提高<span class=\"color-value\">6%</span>，仪式威力提高<span class=\"color-value\">6%</span>，术阵结束后或被顶替后移除额外效果</span></span></span></span></span>：Lv.60 | 5级增幅</div><div style=\"font-weight:bold; font-size:small\"><span class=\"item-link\" data-itemid=\"3121\"><span class=\"item-link-frame\"><span class=\"item-link-rare\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8E%AB%E8%8E%89%E5%BE%B7%E5%B0%94\" title=\"莫莉德尔\"><img alt=\"Bgequip6.png\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/100px-Bgequip6.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit notpageimage\" srcset=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/150px-Bgequip6.png 1.5x, https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/0/08/Bgequip6.png/200px-Bgequip6.png 2x\" data-file-width=\"256\" data-file-height=\"256\" /></a><span class=\"item-link-img\" style=\"width:60%; padding-top:7%;\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8E%AB%E8%8E%89%E5%BE%B7%E5%B0%94\" title=\"莫莉德尔\"><img alt=\"莫莉德尔\" src=\"https://huiji-thumb.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/thumb/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312101.png/100px-HeadIconSmall-312101.png\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"100\" height=\"100\" class=\"img-fit\" srcset=\"https://huiji-public.huijistatic.com/res1999/uploads/d/d2/HeadIconSmall-312101.png 1.5x\" data-file-width=\"136\" data-file-height=\"136\" /></a></span></span></span><span class=\"tooltips\"><a href=\"/wiki/%E8%8E%AB%E8%8E%89%E5%BE%B7%E5%B0%94\" title=\"莫莉德尔\">莫莉德尔</a></